  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "欢迎使用IVD智能故障分析平台",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# IVD智能故障分析平台\n\n## 快速导航\n\n- **业务监控**: 查看[IVD业务监控仪表盘](/d/ivd-business-zh)\n- **系统监控**: 查看[IVD系统监控仪表盘](/d/ivd-monitoring-zh)\n\n## 功能说明\n\n- 实时监控Celery任务执行状态\n- 追踪文件分析性能指标\n- 查看系统资源使用情况\n- 监控HTTP请求和响应时间\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "系统状态概览",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"web\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": "Prometheus"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "运行中",
                  "color": "green"
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "离线",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "请求速率",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(flask_http_request_total[5m])",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": "Prometheus"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "CPU使用率",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 - (avg by(instance) (irate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m])) * 100)",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": "Prometheus"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "内存使用率",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(1 - (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes)) * 100",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": "Prometheus"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 0,
  "refresh": "10s"
}